y:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Meeting Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">MIN-2015-04-8052</code></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">&#10003; QUORUM ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">8 of 11 members present</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Attendance</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Role</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Present</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Ewan Drake</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">OCIO Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Colette Sokolov</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Product Strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Director</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Hind Laurent</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Senior Analyst, Data Science</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Postdoctoral Fellow</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Blanche Nwosu</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of International Partnerships</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Chief Compliance Officer</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Yanto Owens</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Manager of DEI Programs</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Governance Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Miles Bishop</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Senior Manager of Corporate Initiatives</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Executive Vice President</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Albert Wahyudi</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Program Operations</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">R&amp;D Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Martha Richter</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Communications Specialist</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Human Rights Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Selma Lim</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Chief Product Officer</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Co-op</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Sustainability Report 2015 — Draft Review</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee convened to address the urgent matter of the Sustainability Report 2015 — Draft Review. Ewan Drake provided a comprehensive overview of the situation, including its potential impact on Lochsa Consulting&#x27;s operations in the Robotics &amp; Automation sector. The committee deliberated on several response options before proceeding to a vote.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Benefits Renewal — Carrier Selection Update</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Benefits Renewal — Carrier Selection Update was a review of the company&#x27;s brand and reputation metrics. Blanche Nwosu reported a 20-point increase in brand sentiment following the recent marketing campaign.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for milestones:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Partner Ecosystem Committee ratifies the actions of management with respect to the Benefits Renewal — Carrier Selection Update for the period ending 2015-04-12.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Ewan Drake &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Yanto Owens</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 6 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 2 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Regulatory Update: Immigration Reform and Control Act (IRCA) Compliance Briefing</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee considered the Regulatory Update: Immigration Reform and Control Act (IRCA) Compliance Briefing, a proposal to adopt a new policy on charitable contributions. The policy was approved and will be implemented company-wide.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To amend:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Partner Ecosystem Committee shall enter into executive session to discuss confidential matters.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Colette Sokolov &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Martha Richter</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 8 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 4</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">HR Technology Stack Rationalization Plan</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The HR Technology Stack Rationalization Plan was a review of the company&#x27;s performance management process. The committee approved a move to a continuous feedback model, eliminating annual performance reviews.</p></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Reconcile payroll records for affected employees and confirm accuracy with HR</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Minnie Dickerson</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2015-05-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Conduct a sensitivity analysis on the financial projections for the HR Technology Stack Rationalization Plan</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Jochen Simon</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2015-05-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Review the company&#x27;s data privacy policy for compliance with CPRA and GDPR</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Yi Hoang</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2015-06-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Conduct a post-implementation review of the new HRIS platform</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Jose Marks</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2015-05-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 11:45 AM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 2015-05-24</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Selma Lim</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Chief Product Officer, Co-op</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/2015/04/11/regulatory-alignment-memo-3227/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2015/04/12/compliance-audit-findings-4432/phishing-simulation-results-7113/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.7rem\">Meeting Record</div><dl class=\"mb-0\" style=\"font-size:.82rem\"><dt style=\"opacity:.55;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em\">Meeting R